<title>FINLAND: Metsa-Serla Jan-Aug results breakdown.</title>
<headline>Metsa-Serla Jan-Aug results breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metsa-Serla on Thursday published the following breakdown of its results (million markka):</p>
<p> FOUR-MONTH DATA	   May-Aug  Jan-Apr  Sept-Dec  May-Aug</p>
<p>				    96	 96	 95	 95</p>
<p>TURNOVER</p>
<p>  Paper and board	   2,404    2,562     2,043    1,940</p>
<p>  Converting		  1,227    1,323     1,278    1,182</p>
<p>  Base products	     1,477    1,735     1,988    2,137</p>
<p>Internal sales and</p>
<p>  other items		  -485     -717	-624     -736</p>
<p> TOTAL			  4,623    4,903     4,685    4,523</p>
<p>OPERATING PROFIT</p>
<p>  Paper and board		62	103	  68	155</p>
<p>  Converting		    125	130	  86	 91</p>
<p>  Base products		 -19	315	 644	697</p>
<p>  Others			  -66	-75	  34	-85</p>
<p> TOTAL			    102	473	 832	858</p>
<p> NET SALES BY DIVISION	   Jan-Aug    Jan-Aug    Jan-Dec</p>
<p>					    96	   95	   95</p>
<p>Paper and board</p>
